# Architecture

## Shape
See `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` (containers, core request path) and `docs/STRUCTURE.md` (where files go).
## Patterns
- Server components / server code fetch data; client components only for interaction ({{framework rule}}).
- Config read once from `{{lib/config.ts}}`; never `process.env` elsewhere.
- Feature code depends on `ui/`, `lib/`, `hooks/`; `ui/` never imports feature code.

## Never
- Create a second utils/helpers folder
- read env outside config
- add a provider without a reason in DECISIONS.md
